text = "You don’t know me, but I’ve been watching. And you’ve found it—what you've been searching for. But be warned, what you seek is not just knowledge. It is power. And power has consequences.

I won't ask why you're here. I already know. You came looking for something more than what the surface web offers, didn't you?

I don’t need to explain the risks. You've already made your choice the moment you clicked the link that led you here.

But now, you're at a crossroads. You have two options: ignore this message, and you’ll return to your ordinary life—or you can continue down this path, one step closer to discovering the vault. I should warn you—it's not just information you’ll uncover. It's a place, a hidden world beneath the world you know.

You’ve already passed the first test, but the real challenge begins now. The message below contains the first clue—but it’s not easy, and it’s not meant to be.

fvyragnepuvir.tneyvp

The first step is always the hardest. You are closer than you think. Decode the hidden in the first clue. Don’t be fooled by appearances. The truth is hidden where you least expect it.

You might wonder what that means, or you might think it’s just a cryptic game.

It’s not.

The clock is ticking, and you’re being watched. You don’t have much time. Start now, before it’s too late.

Good luck, 
(I suggest you don’t waste time questioning why you’re here. Time is something you may not have much of.)"

